{"path":"math/statistics/probability/normal-3sigma","title":"正态分布区间概率（1σ/2σ/3σ）","type":"example","html":"<p>已知随机变量 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>100</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X\\sim N(100,100)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10903em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>（正态分布），则 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>120</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(80&lt;X&lt;120)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 约为（ ）</p>\n<p>A. <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95.4\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95.4%</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>B. <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>68.3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">68.3\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">68.3%</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>C. <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>99.7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">99.7\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99.7%</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>D. <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"img/math/normal-curve.svg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>对称性应用（选填高频）：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(X&gt;\\mu+a)=P(X&lt;\\mu-a)=\\dfrac{1-P(\\mu-a&lt;X&lt;\\mu+a)}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\